<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIAN CRICKET ACADEMY BEAT PAKISTAN BY 13 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIAN CRICKET ACADEMY BEAT PAKISTAN BY 13 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australlia 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian</p>
<p>Cricket Academy beat Pakistan by 13 runs in their one-day 50</p>
<p>overs match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australian Cricket Academy 248-5 in 50 overs, 235</p>
<p>all out in 48.3 over</p>
</text>
